00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:15.380
We have a huge eight week schedule--

00:04:15.380 --> 00:04:17.900
*lighting fuse* We're- let's set it on fire. Let's go.

00:04:18.280 --> 00:04:20.840
All right. We are on our way to the Cine Gear Expo

00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:23.980
Where we are going to be meeting with Anton Bauer battery company.

00:04:23.980 --> 00:04:26.480
Anton Bauer is like one of the old standbys of

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:28.240
battery tech in the film industry.

00:04:28.380 --> 00:04:31.100
Back in the day, they made a solid battery that had a mount called the Gold Mount.

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:35.890
It's been used for basically every professional camera. Anytime, you see, like, a camera as the prop in the movie,

00:04:35.890 --> 00:04:37.940
It's usually an Anton Bauer battery on the back of it.

00:04:37.940 --> 00:04:41.460
They have new batteries that just launched today. No, yesterday.

00:04:41.480 --> 00:04:44.440
