00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:57.020
then a set of batteries just dedicated to our cameras.

00:04:57.020 --> 00:04:58.040
I hate wires,

00:04:58.040 --> 00:04:59.800
so that's why I use batteries for all our lights

00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:00.980
and that's why they're all LED.

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:03.160
Most people don't know that Anton Bauer makes v-lock batteries.

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:04.420
So now, you know.

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:06.040
Anton Bauer makes V-lock batteries.

